Package: conduit
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Conduit contributors <thowd22@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: @RECOMMENDS@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/thowd22/Conduit
Description: Terminal workspace for humans and coding agents
 Conduit is a terminal workspace built on libghostty. It combines tabs,
 split panes, a command palette and a persistent scratchpad with first-class
 support for coding-agent CLIs and Backlog.md planning. Everything looks and
 feels like a terminal; mouse and keyboard are equal inputs.
 .
 This package installs the conduit binary, its bundled fallback font, the
 bash/zsh/fish shell integration, the freedesktop desktop entry and icon, and
 the license notices of Conduit and its vendored dependencies under
 /usr/share/licenses/conduit.
